{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dachs Hunter is a roguelike survival game where you play as a dachshund wizard rising to power and you must fight your way through hordes of elemental enemies and bosses. Grab loots, unlock spells and find items on the way, level up your spellbook, Improve your attributes and try to survive.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3499910/extras/055af1005f167706004b2f2336ad7b47.poster.avif?t=1772580465\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3499910/extras/055af1005f167706004b2f2336ad7b47.webm?t=1772580465\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3499910/extras/055af1005f167706004b2f2336ad7b47.mp4?t=1772580465\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Try to survive:</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enjoy casual runs that last around 20 minutes, where each run lets you experiment with up to 60 different spells and create unique builds by combining multiple elements.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3499910/extras/763c602862216d24fc3e3f97b6ef651a.poster.avif?t=1772580465\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3499910/extras/763c602862216d24fc3e3f97b6ef651a.webm?t=1772580465\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3499910/extras/763c602862216d24fc3e3f97b6ef651a.mp4?t=1772580465\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >What the game contains:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"